# Verification Code — 5 code boxes fed by an invisible auto-focused number-pad
# TextInput (correct code 11111). Digits flip in (FlipInXDown) and out, the
# highlighted box follows the cursor, a wrong code turns the borders red and
# shakes the row, the right code turns them green; both reset after 1s.
# What this test covers: partial entry + backspace (FlipOutXDown exits), the
# correct code, a wrong code (shake + red), typing more digits while the wrong
# state is showing (length > 5 is ignored, then the 1s reset clears the input),
# tapping the boxes to refocus, and a final correct entry.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/verification-code"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "Enter Code" 10000
wait "label=\"Delete\"" 5000
wait 800
type "123"
wait 800
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 300
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 800
# "1" left in the input -> complete with four more ones = 11111 (correct).
type "1111"
wait 2000
# Wrong code -> red + shake, then extra digits while it is still showing.
type "12345"
type "9"
wait 2000
# Refocus by tapping the code row, then a backspace on an empty input.
press 201 356
wait 500
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 500
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 2000
wait "text" "Enter Code" 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
